#set text(size: 11pt)

every character a notation escapes, set as text: link\_to, 100% & \#1 costs \$5 {net} \~ ^ \\ \*star\* \@ref \<label\>, and `a_name` in backticks set in code

== Sets
/ $cal(B)$: index $b$ --- `bp`
/ $cal(U)$: index $u$ --- `bus` with $upright("area_of"): cal(U) arrow.r cal(Z), upright("connection") subset.eq cal(U) times cal(G), upright("gen_bt"): cal(G) arrow.r cal(U) times cal(E), upright("gen_bus"): cal(G) arrow.r cal(U), upright("zone_of"): cal(U) arrow.r cal(Z)$, `area_of` is `absent` where the data has no row, `connection` is `absent` where the data has no row
/ $cal(G)$: index $g$ --- `generator` with $upright("connection") subset.eq cal(U) times cal(G), upright("gen_bt"): cal(G) arrow.r cal(U) times cal(E), upright("gen_bus"): cal(G) arrow.r cal(U), upright("gen_zone"): cal(G) times cal(T) arrow.r cal(Z)$, `connection` is `absent` where the data has no row
/ $cal(S)$: index $s$ --- `season` with $upright("season_of"): cal(T) arrow.r cal(S)$
/ $cal(T)$: index $t$ --- `snapshot` (`int` coordinates) with $upright("gen_zone"): cal(G) times cal(T) arrow.r cal(Z), upright("rep_of"): cal(T) arrow.r cal(T), upright("season_of"): cal(T) arrow.r cal(S)$
/ $cal(E)$: index $e$ --- `technology` with $upright("gen_bt"): cal(G) arrow.r cal(U) times cal(E)$
/ $cal(Z)$: index $z$ --- `zone` with $upright("area_of"): cal(U) arrow.r cal(Z), upright("gen_zone"): cal(G) times cal(T) arrow.r cal(Z), upright("zone_of"): cal(U) arrow.r cal(Z)$, `area_of` is `absent` where the data has no row

== Parameters
/ $upright("bp_heat")$: `bp_heat` over $cal(B) times cal(G)$
/ $upright("bp_run")$: `bp_run` over $cal(B) times cal(G)$
/ $upright("bp_x")$: `bp_x` over $cal(B) times cal(G)$, `neutral` where the data has no row
/ $upright("bp_y")$: `bp_y` over $cal(B) times cal(G)$, `neutral` where the data has no row
/ $upright("budget")$: `budget` (scalar)
/ $upright("cost")$: `cost` over $cal(G)$, `neutral` where the data has no row
/ $upright("eta")$: `eta` over $cal(G)$
/ $upright("growth")$: `growth` (scalar)
/ $upright("is_flexible")$: `is_flexible` over $cal(G)$, `false` where the data has no row
/ $upright("lead")$: `lead` over $cal(G)$
/ $upright("load")$: `load` over $cal(U) times cal(T)$
/ $upright("min_up")$: `min_up` over $cal(G)$
/ $upright("p")^(upright("max"))$: `p_max` over $cal(G)$, $infinity$ where the data has no row
/ $upright("p")^(upright("min"))$: `p_min` over $cal(G)$
/ $upright("tech_cap")$: `tech_cap` over $cal(U) times cal(E)$, `absent` where the data has no row
/ $upright("zone_cap")$: `zone_cap` over $cal(Z)$

== Conditions
/ $upright("dispatchable")$: `dispatchable` over $cal(G)$ --- a unit that dispatches and cannot be turned down
/ $upright("priced_dispatch")$: `priced_dispatch` over $cal(G)$

== Variables
/ $italic("fuel")$: `fuel` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$
/ $italic("headroom")$: `headroom` (scalar), `neutral` where the mask leaves it out
/ $italic("heat")$: `heat` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$
/ $italic("on")$: `on` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$
/ $italic("op_cost")$: `op_cost` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$
/ $p$: `p` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$
/ $italic("reserve")$: `reserve` (scalar)
/ $italic("slack")$: `slack` over $cal(T)$
/ $italic("spare")$: `spare` over $cal(G)$
/ $italic("spill")$: `spill` over $cal(T)$
/ $theta$: `theta` over $cal(U)$
/ $italic("units")$: `units` over $cal(G)$
/ $italic("warm")$: `warm` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$
/ $italic("weight")$: `weight` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$

== Definitions
/ $italic("lcoe")$: `lcoe` (scalar)
/ $italic("marginal_price")$: `marginal_price` over $cal(U) times cal(T)$
/ $italic("net")$: `net` over $cal(T)$ --- what a snapshot spills, less what it lacks
/ $upright("rating")$: `rating` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$
/ $italic("spend")$: `spend` over $cal(T)$ --- what a snapshot's dispatch costs
/ $upright("spend")^(upright("cap"))$: `spend_cap` over $cal(G)$
/ $upright("startup_cost")$: `startup_cost` over $cal(G) times cal(T)$ --- what starting a unit in this snapshot costs, which the horizon's edge changes

== Notation
/ $t minus.o k$: `edge='wrap'` --- $t-k$, cyclic
/ $t minus.square_(v) k$: `edge=v` --- $t-k$, and $v$ past the edge
/ $t minus.o^(upright("relation")(t)) k$: `within=relation[...]` --- $t-k$ inside the group of $t$
/ $upright("pos")(t)$: `position()` --- the position of $t$, counted from $0$; $t$ is the label
/ $upright("pos")_(upright("relation")(t))(t)$: `position(within=relation[...])` --- the position of $t$ inside its group
/ $abs(cal(T))$: the size of $cal(T)$; $abs(cal(T)) - 1$ is the last position

== Conditions
#set math.equation(numbering: "(1)")
$ upright("dispatchable") & upright("dispatchable")_(g) & arrow.l.r.double.long upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) > 0 and not upright("is_flexible")_(g) & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("priced_dispatch") & upright("priced_dispatch")_(g) & arrow.l.r.double.long upright("dispatchable")_(g) and upright("spend")^(upright("cap"))_(g) > 0 & forall g in cal(G) $

== Variable domains
#set math.equation(numbering: "(1)")
$ upright("fuel") & italic("fuel")_(g,t) & >= 0 & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("headroom") & italic("headroom") & >= 0 & upright("where ") upright("budget") upright(" is defined") \
  upright("heat") & italic("heat")_(g,t) & >= 0 & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("on") & italic("on")_(g,t) & in {0, 1} & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("op_cost") & italic("op_cost")_(g,t) & >= 0 & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("p") & upright("p")^(upright("min"))_(g) <= p_(g,t) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) > 0 and not upright("is_flexible")_(g) or upright("p")^(upright("min"))_(g) > 0 \
  upright("reserve") & italic("reserve") & >= 0 \
  upright("slack") & italic("slack")_(t) & <= 100 & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("spare") & italic("spare")_(g) & in ZZ & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("spill") & italic("spill")_(t) & >= 0 & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("theta") & theta_(u) & in RR & forall u in cal(U) \
  upright("units") & 0 <= italic("units")_(g) & <= 10, italic("units")_(g) in ZZ & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("warm") & italic("warm")_(g,t) & in {0, 1} & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("is_flexible")_(g) \
  upright("weight") & 0 <= italic("weight")_(g,t) & <= 1 & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) $

== Definitions
#set math.equation(numbering: "(1)")
$ upright("lcoe") & italic("lcoe") & = frac(sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) dot upright("cost")_(g), sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t)) \
  upright("marginal_price") & italic("marginal_price")_(u,t) & = lambda_(upright("balance"),u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) \
  upright("net") & italic("net")_(t) & = -italic("spill")_(t) + italic("slack")_(t) & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("rating") & upright("rating")_(g,t) & = upright("eta")_(g) dot upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) dot (sum_(u in cal(U)) upright("load")_(u,t)) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("spend") & italic("spend")_(t) & = sum_(g in cal(G)) p_(g,t) dot upright("cost")_(g) & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("spend_cap") & upright("spend")^(upright("cap"))_(g) & = upright("cost")_(g) dot 2 & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("startup_cost") & upright("startup_cost")_(g,t) & = cases(upright("cost")_(g) & upright("if ") upright("pos")(t) = 0, upright("cost")_(g) dot 2 & upright("if ") upright("pos")(t) > 0 and upright("season_of")(t) = upright("'winter'"), 0 & upright("otherwise")) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) $

== Objective
#set math.equation(numbering: "(1)")
$  & max & sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) dot upright("cost")_(g) + sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) dot p_(g,t) dot upright("cost")_(g) + sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) dot upright("cost")_(g) dot upright("growth")^(upright("lead")_(g)) + sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) dot (upright("growth")^(upright("lead")_(g)))^(2) + sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) dot upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) - italic("reserve") - italic("headroom") $

== Subject to
#set math.equation(numbering: "(1)")
$ upright("ahead") & p_(g,t) & <= p_(g,t plus.o 1) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("always") & italic("spill")_(t) & >= 0 & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("arithmetic") & sum_(g in cal(G)) (frac(p_(g,t), 2) - upright("cost")_(g) + 10^(-5) dot p_(g,t) + 2.5 times 10^(-7) dot upright("cost")_(g) + 0.5 dot p_(g,t)) & >= -(sum_(g in cal(G)) p_(g,t)) dot (-3) & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("balance") & sum_(g in cal(G) colon upright("gen_bus")(g) = u) p_(g,t) + italic("spill")_(t) - italic("slack")_(t) & = upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) \
  upright("budgeted") & italic("spend")_(t) & <= upright("budget") & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("capped") & p_(g,t) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("spend")^(upright("cap"))_(g) > 0 or not upright("is_flexible")_(g) \
  upright("ceiling") & theta_(u) & <= infinity & forall u in cal(U) \
  upright("composed") & p_(g,t - 2) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("connected") & p_(g,t) & <= upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon (u, g) in upright("connection") \
  upright("counted") & theta_(u) & <= upright("budget") & forall u in cal(U) colon abs({e in cal(E) colon upright("tech_cap")_(u,e) > 0}) >= 2 \
  upright("counted_here") & theta_(u) & <= upright("tech_cap")_(u,e) & forall u in cal(U), e in cal(E) colon abs({e' in cal(E) colon upright("tech_cap")_(u,e') > 0}) >= 2 \
  upright("covered") & sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) & <= upright("budget") & upright("where ") sum_(g in cal(G)) upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) >= upright("budget") \
  upright("crossed") & p_(g + 1,t minus.o 1) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("edges") & p_(g,t minus.square_(0) 1) & <= p_(g,t plus.square_(0) 1) + upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("efficiency") & p_(g,t) & <= upright("eta")_(g) dot upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("first") & italic("on")_(g,t) & = 1 & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("pos")(t) = 0 or upright("pos")_(upright("season_of")(t))(t) = 0 \
  upright("grouped_once") & sum_(g in cal(G) colon upright("gen_bt.bus")(g) = u and upright("gen_bt.technology")(g) = e) p_(g,t) & <= upright("tech_cap")_(u,e) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T), e in cal(E) \
  upright("held_in_season") & p_(g,t) & <= p_(g,t minus.square_(0)^(upright("season_of")(t)) 1) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("history") & sum_(t' in cal(T) colon 0 <= t minus.o t' < upright("min_up")) italic("on")_(g,t') & <= italic("units")_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("in_season") & p_(g,t) & <= p_(g,t minus.o^(upright("season_of")(t)) 1) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("last") & italic("on")_(g,t) & = 0 & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("pos")(t) = abs(cal(T)) - 1 or upright("pos")_(upright("season_of")(t))(t) = abs(cal(T)_(upright("season_of")(t))) - 1 \
  upright("lead_time") & p_(g,t minus.square_(0) upright("lead")) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("looked_up_once") & italic("units")_(g) & <= upright("tech_cap")_(upright("gen_bt.bus")(g),upright("gen_bt.technology")(g)) & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("lookup") & italic("spill")_(t) & <= upright("zone_cap")_(upright("zone_of")(u)) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) \
  upright("margin") & p_(g,t) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) - upright("p")^(upright("min"))_(g) > frac(upright("cost")_(g), 2) \
  upright("masked") & p_(g,t) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("priced_dispatch")_(g) and upright("pos")(t) > 0 \
  upright("netted") & sum_(g in cal(G) colon upright("gen_bus")(g) = u) p_(g,t) + italic("net")_(t) & = upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) \
  upright("never") & italic("slack")_(t) & >= 0 & forall t in cal(T) colon bot \
  upright("northern") & italic("slack")_(t) & <= upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) colon upright("zone_of")(u) = upright("'north'") and upright("zone_of")(u) != upright("area_of")(u) and upright("zone_of")(u) upright(" is defined") \
  upright("ramp") & p_(g,t) - p_(g,t minus.o 1) & <= p_(g,t - 1) + upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("ramped") & italic("slack")_(t) & <= upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) colon upright("load")_(u,t) - upright("load")_(u,t minus.square_(0) 1) <= upright("zone_cap")_(upright("zone_of")(u)) and upright("pos")(t) > 0 \
  upright("redundant") & italic("spill")_(t) & >= 0 & forall t in cal(T) colon italic("spill")_(t) upright(" exists") \
  upright("relational") & sum_(g in cal(G) colon (u, g) in upright("connection")) p_(g,t) & <= upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) \
  upright("representative") & sum_(t' in cal(T) colon upright("rep_of")(t') = t) italic("spill")_(t') & <= italic("spill")_(upright("rep_of")(t)) & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("run_start") & italic("slack")_(t) & <= upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) colon upright("load")_(u,t) upright(" is defined") and not (upright("load")_(u,t - 1) upright(" is defined")) \
  upright("running") & theta_(u) & <= upright("load")_(u,t) & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) colon theta_(u) upright(" exists") and t >= 3 \
  upright("scalar") & italic("units")_(g) & <= upright("budget") & forall g in cal(G) colon upright("cost")_(g) upright(" is defined") \
  upright("seasonal_window") & sum_(t' in cal(T) colon 0 <= t -^(upright("season_of")(t)) t' < 3) italic("on")_(g,t') & <= italic("units")_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("starts") & p_(g,t) & <= upright("startup_cost")_(g,t) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("total") & sum_(g in cal(G), t in cal(T)) p_(g,t) & <= upright("budget") \
  upright("uncomposed") & p_(g,(t - 1) minus.square_(0) upright("lead")) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("under_rating") & p_(g,t) & <= upright("rating")_(g,t) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("window") & sum_(t' in cal(T) colon 0 <= t - t' < 3) italic("on")_(g,t') & <= italic("units")_(g) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("within_bus") & italic("units")_(g) & <= italic("units")_(g minus.square_(0)^(upright("gen_bt.bus")(g)) 1) & forall g in cal(G) colon upright("pos")_((upright("gen_bt.bus")(g), upright("gen_bt.technology")(g)))(g) = 0 \
  upright("zonal") & sum_(g in cal(G) colon upright("gen_zone")(g, t) = z) p_(g,t) & <= upright("zone_cap")_(z) & forall t in cal(T), z in cal(Z) \
  upright("zonal_history") & sum_(t in cal(T) colon upright("gen_zone")(g, t) = z) p_(g,t) & <= upright("zone_cap")_(z) & forall g in cal(G), z in cal(Z) \
  upright("zonal_lookup") & p_(g,t) & <= italic("spill")_(t) dot upright("zone_cap")_(upright("gen_zone")(g, t)) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) colon upright("gen_zone")(g, t) = upright("'north'") and upright("pos")_(upright("gen_zone")(g, t))(g) = 0 \
  upright("zonal_membership") & sum_(g in cal(G) colon upright("gen_zone")(g, t) upright(" is defined")) italic("units")_(g) & <= upright("budget") & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("zoned") & theta_(u) & <= upright("budget") & forall u in cal(U) colon upright("zone_cap")_(upright("zone_of")(u)) upright(" is defined") \
  upright("adjacent") & (italic("weight")_(g,t))_(g in cal(G)) & in upright("SOS")2 & forall t in cal(T) \
  upright("cost_curve") & italic("op_cost")_(g,t) & >= cases(italic("warm")_(g,t) & upright("if ") upright("is_flexible")_(g), 1 & upright("otherwise")) dot upright("pwl")_(b in cal(B) colon upright("bp_run")_(b,g))(upright("bp_x")_(b,g), upright("bp_y")_(b,g))(p_(g,t)) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("fuel_curve") & (p_(g,t), italic("fuel")_(g,t), italic("heat")_(g,t)) & in italic("on")_(g,t) dot upright("pwl")_(b in cal(B))(upright("bp_x")_(b,g), upright("bp_y")_(b,g), upright("bp_heat")_(b,g)) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("hull_curve") & (p_(g,t), italic("fuel")_(g,t)) & in upright("conv")_(b in cal(B))(upright("bp_x")_(b,g), upright("bp_heat")_(b,g)) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("lp_curve") & italic("fuel")_(g,t) & >= upright("pwl")_(b in cal(B) colon upright("bp_x")_(b,g) upright(" is defined"))(upright("bp_x")_(b,g), upright("bp_y")_(b,g))(p_(g,t)) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) \
  upright("ramp_curve") & italic("heat")_(g,t) & <= upright("pwl")_(b in cal(B))(upright("bp_x")_(b,g), upright("bp_heat")_(b,g))(p_(g,t)) & forall g in cal(G), t in cal(T) $

== Assumptions
#set math.equation(numbering: "(1)")
$ upright("bounds_do_not_cross") & upright("p")^(upright("min"))_(g) & <= upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("budget_covers_the_peak") & sum_(g in cal(G)) upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & >= upright("budget") \
  upright("efficiency_is_a_fraction") & upright("eta")_(g) > 0 and upright("eta")_(g) <= 1 &  & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("flexible_units_have_headroom") & upright("p")^(upright("min"))_(g) & < upright("p")^(upright("max"))_(g) & forall g in cal(G) colon upright("is_flexible")_(g) \
  upright("lead_times_are_short") & upright("lead")_(g) & <= 3 & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("northern_demand_is_real") & upright("load")_(u,t) & >= 0 & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) colon upright("zone_of")(u) = upright("'north'") \
  upright("ramps_are_gentle") & upright("load")_(u,t) - upright("load")_(u,t minus.square_(0) 1) & <= upright("budget") & forall u in cal(U), t in cal(T) colon upright("pos")(t) > 0 \
  upright("zones_agree") & upright("zone_of")(u) & = upright("area_of")(u) & forall u in cal(U) \
  upright("cost_curve_complete") & upright("bp_x")_(b,g) upright(" is defined") and upright("bp_y")_(b,g) upright(" is defined") &  & forall b in cal(B), g in cal(G) colon upright("bp_run")_(b,g) \
  upright("cost_curve_contiguous") & abs({b in cal(B) colon upright("bp_run")_(b,g) and not upright("bp_run")_(b - 1,g)}) & = 1 & forall g in cal(G) \
  upright("fuel_curve_complete") & upright("bp_x")_(b,g) upright(" is defined") and upright("bp_y")_(b,g) upright(" is defined") and upright("bp_heat")_(b,g) upright(" is defined") &  & forall b in cal(B), g in cal(G) \
  upright("hull_curve_complete") & upright("bp_x")_(b,g) upright(" is defined") and upright("bp_heat")_(b,g) upright(" is defined") &  & forall b in cal(B), g in cal(G) \
  upright("hull_curve_increasing") & upright("bp_x")_(b minus.square_(0) 1,g) & < upright("bp_x")_(b,g) & forall b in cal(B), g in cal(G) colon upright("pos")(b) > 0 \
